description=Because hacking away at your own arm with a hunting knife in the bathroom just isn't a sustainable long-term workout routine for grinding First Aid, it's time to let someone else do the bleeding.<LINE><LINE>The Coroner: Autopsy Mod brings a complete forensic pathology system to Project Zomboid Build 42, turning corpse management into the ultimate, hands-on training ground for your medical skills. Examine body temperatures, track exact wound histories, perform precision surgical mini-games, and harvest organs—which are fully edible, though eating a zed's liver is strongly discouraged... unless you're looking to poison your cheating husband. Just remember to pair a nice liver with some fava beans and a bottle of Chianti.
